meta {
  name: Get File import Results
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/errors/:import_id/check
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  import_id: 
}

docs {
  Check the import response of various file imports for any error, including bulk order imports, products and product listings.

  You will have to pass the file import id as a path parameter in the endpoint URL. This id is provided at the time of importing the file.
  No other body parameters are required. 

  ##### Path:

  | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|
  | [https://apiv2.shiprocket.in/v1/external/errors/20212061/check](https://apiv2.shiprocket.in/v1/external/errors/20212061/check) |
}
